<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Distillers raises interim div.</title>
<headline>Distillers raises interim div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Distillers Corporation (SA) Ltd said on Friday it had declared an interim dividend of 21 cents versus 17 cents per ordinary share.</p>
<p>It said the final dividend would be paid to shareholders registered on February 21 and paid out around February 28.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
